# ============================================================
# sEMG Lower-Limb Movement Recognition, MSc thesis project
# Layout since 30 September 2026: see docs/LAYOUT.md
# ============================================================

# -- RAW DATASETS (49 GB) --------------------------------------------------
# SIAT-LLMD (25 GB) and the ENABL3S Figshare deposit 5362627 (24 GB, ten per-subject
# archives each over GitHub's 100 MB limit). Both are public; obtain them from the
# original authors (Wei et al., 2023; Hu, Rouse & Hargrove, 2018).
data/raw/

# -- WINDOWED ARRAYS (230-430 MB each) ---------------------------------------
# Written by src/preprocess_emg.py. Over GitHub's per-file limit and regenerable.
# The window metadata and the derived feature matrices beside them ARE tracked.
data/windows/*.npz
data/features_out_ext/windows_ENABL3S_WAK_UPS_DNS_STDUP_w250_ov50_conf60.npz
data/features_out_ext/checkpoints/
data/features_out_filter/windows_*.npz
results/kc23_*/windows_*.npz
results/kc23_*/checkpoints/

# -- RAW EMG PLOTS (183 MB, regenerable from src/batch_save_plot.py) --------
figures/plots/

# -- LOGS AND RUNTIME STATE -------------------------------------------------
*.log
pipeline_log.txt
*.lock
*.pid

# -- PYTHON -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/

# -- VIRTUAL ENVIRONMENTS ---------------------------------------------------
# .venv is frozen for reproduction; .venv_stats holds statsmodels for the D1
# MixedLM model only (requirements-stats.txt); .venv-verify is a second check env.
venv/
env/
.env/
.venv/
.venv_stats/
.venv-verify/

